        <body>
            <div xml:id="d15-a3">

                <pb facs="0326" n="316" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv09/pg316"/>

                <head>Appendix B to HD–99</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">president of
                            the<lb/>german peace delegation</hi>
                        <lb/> No. 447</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-11-23">November 23, 1919</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">From: Baron von Lersner.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">To: The Secretary General of the Peace Conference.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to request that your Excellency kindly postpone the session
                    announced in the letter of the 22nd instant until the return of the Director of
                    the Ministry, von Simson, and the experts accompanying him.</p>
                <p>Kindly accept, etc.</p>
                <closer>[No signature on file copy]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
